1
00:00:34,795 --> 00:00:45,887
We glide under a burning sun,
The highway road is almost done.

2
00:00:47,003 --> 00:00:58,227
The border signs are drawing near,
And all our freedom shrinks in fear.

3
00:00:59,156 --> 00:01:09,692
The cold asphalt is drawing near,
Our golden week of freedom gone.

4
00:01:11,231 --> 00:01:21,731
The Lion whimpers, choked with fear:
We were made whole, but just for now.

5
00:01:26,393 --> 00:01:37,388
You press your hand against my heart,
To whisper that we have to part.

6
00:01:38,597 --> 00:01:48,989
The front door closes with a click,
The cold wind cuts me to the quick.

7
00:01:50,715 --> 00:02:01,265
The cold asphalt is drawing near,
Our golden week of freedom gone.

8
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:13,397
The Lion whimpers, choked with fear:
We were made whole, but just for now.

9
00:02:18,383 --> 00:02:28,675
Francien whispers: 'Look at how
They both became so whole just now.'

10
00:02:30,502 --> 00:02:40,772
Albert nods with heavy eyes:
'For just a moment,' he replies.

11
00:02:42,471 --> 00:02:52,848
The cold asphalt is drawing near,
Our golden week of freedom gone.

12
00:02:54,541 --> 00:03:05,127
The Lion whimpers, choked with fear:
We were made whole, but just for now.

13
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:23,291
On that last night, we loved so deep,
With strict rules that we had to keep.

14
00:03:25,041 --> 00:03:35,125
I stopped myself with burning pain,
To sleep alone in cold again.

15
00:03:37,224 --> 00:03:47,960
I hold myself in hopeless grief,
To find a moment of relief.

16
00:03:49,332 --> 00:03:59,696
My lonely tears run down my face,
No longer in your warm embrace.

17
00:04:04,514 --> 00:04:14,842
The cold asphalt is drawing near,
Our golden week of freedom gone.

18
00:04:16,647 --> 00:04:26,666
The Lion whimpers, choked with fear:
We were made whole, but just for now.

19
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:45,755
The Lion does not roar tonight,
He has no strength left for the fight.

20
00:04:46,991 --> 00:04:59,219
He whimpers, silent, broken, deep,
And cries himself to bitter sleep.

